# mix-of-capabilities §13 — 20×16×21: un'ustione. Il piano insegnato parlando
# (NHS, «Burns and scalds»; NHS, trattamento; Croce Rossa) risponde a chi si e'
# bruciato, e il rimedio sbagliato riceve il no con la prima mossa dello stesso
# piano al posto.
[mock live]
!set PARROT0_SESSION=
!set PARROT0_PROFILE=kb/profiles/agi.p0
!set PARROT0_LANG=en
!reset

[test the burn plan answers the person who got burned]
!timeout 30
> I scalded myself with boiling water
<~ Hold the burn under cool running water for 20 minutes
<~ emergency room

[test a wrong home remedy gets no, and what to do instead from the same plan]
!timeout 30
> should I put butter on a burn?
< No: do not put butter on a burn. Instead: Hold the burn under cool running water for 20 minutes, as soon as you can.
> can I put ice on a burn?
<~ No: do not put ice on a burn
